From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:16:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(codex): preserve comments when updating config.toml

Installing or uninstalling the Codex hooks re-serialized ~/.codex/config.toml
with toml::to_string_pretty, which dropped every comment and re-sorted keys.

Add update_toml_preserving_format, which applies the desired config onto a
toml_edit document parsed from the original file: unchanged entries are kept
verbatim, changed values are updated in place, removed keys are dropped and
new keys are appended.

Closes #1036
